<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <nav>
    <strong>Portfolio Website</strong>
    <div><a href="#work">Showcases</a><a href="#skills">Skillset</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></div>
  </nav>

  <header class="hero">
    <h1>Ramit Kumar</h1>
    <div class="role">Mechanical and Thermal Design Engineer</div>
  </header>

  <div class="intro">
    <div class="profile">
      <h2 class="ptitle">Profile summary</h2>
      <p>Mechanical Design Engineer with nearly 2 years of industry experience in EV product development, specializing in battery pack enclosures, chassis design, and thermal management systems.</p>
      <p>Proficient in Creo Parametric, ANSYS Fluent, ANSYS Mechanical, and ANSYS Icepak, with expertise in CFD, FEA, conjugate heat transfer (CHT), and simulation-driven design optimization.</p>
      <p>Skilled in GD&amp;T, tolerance engineering, DFMA, and PLM, with hands-on experience in structural validation, battery cooling optimization, and cross-functional product development.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section id="work">
    <h2>Showcases</h2>
    <div class="proj">
      <h3>Mechanical design showcases</h3>
      <div>
        <p>Design and structural simulation based validation of Two wheeler EV components like chassis, swingarms and battery mounting fixtures at Plasma Motors</p>
        <div class="shots">
          <figure class="shot"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="CAD render of an EV scooter swingarm with a cross tube, mounting plates and brackets" width="782" height="556"><figcaption>EV scooter swingarm design for mid drive and hub motor compatibility</figcaption></figure>
          <figure class="shot"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Engineering drawing of the swingarm with top, side and bottom views, an isometric view and dimensions" width="1010" height="712"><figcaption>Engineering drawing of the swingarm. Click an image to enlarge.</figcaption></figure>
        </div>
